    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** 2 BEDROOM SEMI DETACHED HOUSE***\r\n\r\nKillian Lynch Auctioneers are pleased to offer this 2 bedroom semi detached house with front & rear gardens. The property comprises of c.710 sq ft living accommodation & is in turn key condition throughout. This property would make an ideal opportunity for those looking to downsize or move within walking distance of all local amenities. Located only c.5 minutes walking distance to Millstreet town, c.20 minutes drive to Macroom town, c.25 minutes drive to Killarney and a c.45 minute drive to Cork city. \r\n\r\nServices:Mains water & drainage, ESB, Oil fired central heating."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hall - 1.9m x 1.8m \r\nWooden flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.7m x 2.7m \r\nWooden flooring, fitted kitchen, worktop, sink, integrated hob & oven, extractor fan, door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.5m x 3.3m \r\nWooden flooring, hot press, solid fuel stove with tile surrounding. \r\n\r\nLanding - 2.2m x 1.0m \r\nCarpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.0m x 1.6m \r\nTiled throughout, W.C, W.H.B, electric shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.4m x 2.4m \r\nCarpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.5m x 3.4m \r\nCarpet flooring. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
